<section class="section ethics-panel" aria-label="Conservation publishing notice">
  <p class="eyebrow">Conservation-Safe Publishing</p>
  <p>
    This page deliberately omits patrol-post locations, protection schedules, animal coordinates, release
    sites and other operational detail that could increase wildlife risk. Public accountability can be
    supported through aggregated, dated outcomes without exposing sensitive field information.
  </p>
